<!doctype html>
{%- comment -%}
  EyeWipes pre-lander — dedicated layout.

  Used only by templates/page.eyewipes-prelander.json. Deliberately excludes the
  store header, main navigation, announcement bar, footer and every other global
  theme element so the approved Claude Design page renders exactly as designed.

  Everything Shopify needs is still here: content_for_header, content_for_layout,
  viewport metadata, title/meta and canonical.
{%- endcomment -%}
<html class="eyewipes-prelander-html" lang="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#47B5E9">
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url }}">

    {%- if settings.favicon != blank -%}
      <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ settings.favicon | image_url: width: 32, height: 32 }}">
    {%- endif -%}

    <title>{{ page_title }}{% if shop.name != page_title %} &ndash; {{ shop.name }}{% endif %}</title>

    {%- if page_description -%}
      <meta name="description" content="{{ page_description | escape }}">
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} Preload the two assets that gate the first paint. {%- endcomment -%}
    <link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" href="{{ 'ewpl-geist-bold.woff2' | asset_url }}" crossorigin>
    <link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" href="{{ 'ewpl-geist-regular.woff2' | asset_url }}" crossorigin>
    {%- if settings.sales_campaign_mode == 'world_animal_week' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Caveat: the World Animal Week "Week" script lockup. Loaded
      unconditionally (both the evergreen and WAW top-bar/offer-card variants
      are always in the DOM - see sections/eyewipes-prelander.liquid - and
      Shopify Liquid has no supported way to read ?waw_preview=1 server-side,
      so there's no reliable signal here to gate this on). One extra small
      font request, always paid, is simpler and safer than getting it wrong.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@700&display=swap">
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- assign pl_suffix = '' -%}
    {%- if settings.sales_campaign_mode == 'world_animal_week' -%}{%- assign pl_suffix = '-waw' -%}{%- endif -%}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'eyewipes-prelander' | append: pl_suffix | append: '.css' | asset_url }}">
    {%- if settings.sales_campaign_mode == 'world_animal_week' -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      ?waw_preview=1 QA override - forces the WAW variant visible with no
      flash. Must run before first paint (blocking, in <head>, before the
      stylesheet's data-waw-preview rules are needed) and Shopify Liquid
      cannot read this query param server-side (request.query_string is not
      a real property), so this is necessarily client-side. Reads
      location.search directly rather than URLSearchParams so it still works
      if this ever runs before that's available.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <script>
      (function () {
        try {
          if (/(?:^|[?&])waw_preview=1(?:&|$)/.test(window.location.search)) {
            document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-waw-preview', '1');
          }
        } catch (e) {}
      }());
    </script>
    {%- endif -%}

    <style>
      @font-face { font-family: "GeistEwpl"; src: url("{{ 'ewpl-geist-regular.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2"); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; }
      @font-face { font-family: "GeistEwpl"; src: url("{{ 'ewpl-geist-medium.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2"); font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; }
      @font-face { font-family: "GeistEwpl"; src: url("{{ 'ewpl-geist-semibold.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2"); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; }
      @font-face { font-family: "GeistEwpl"; src: url("{{ 'ewpl-geist-bold.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2"); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; }
      @font-face { font-family: "GeistEwpl"; src: url("{{ 'ewpl-geist-extrabold.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2"); font-weight: 800; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; }
    </style>

    {{ content_for_header }}
  </head>

  <body class="eyewipes-prelander-body">
    {{ content_for_layout }}

    {%- if settings.sales_campaign_mode == 'world_animal_week' -%}
    <script src="{{ 'vp-countdown.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
    {%- endif -%}
    <script src="{{ 'eyewipes-prelander' | append: pl_suffix | append: '.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
  </body>
</html>
